@startuml get-built-in-characteristics
title GET /race/builtin — getBuiltInCharacteristics
' Endpoint que NO accede a BD: solo enumera los enums del dominio.

actor Cliente
participant "RaceCharacteristicController" as RCC
participant "CharacteristicServiceImpl\n(implements CharacteristicService)" as CS
participant "BuiltInCharacteristicsEnum" as BICE

Cliente -> RCC : GET /race/builtin
RCC -> CS : getBuiltInCharacteristics()
CS -> BICE : values()
loop para cada enum
    BICE --> CS : getCharacteristicMeta().getCode()
end
CS -> CS : toList()  ' códigos con sufijo _RACE (STRENGTH_MINIMUM_RACE, ...)
CS --> RCC : List<String> (códigos)
RCC --> Cliente : 200 OK [List<String>]

@enduml